# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
*.tfplan
# `-out=tfplan` with no extension is what the deploy workflow and the apply commands in
# infra/README.md both write, so the pattern above never matched the file anyone actually
# produces. A saved plan embeds resource attributes read back from state -- for these roots
# that includes subnet and security group ids -- and it is worthless once applied.
tfplan

